---
name: dev-complete
version: 1.0.0
description: Developer completion report for a dev-task; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - sprint
  - branch
  - commit
  - deliverables_complete
  - deliverables_total
  - deliverables_md
  - validation_md
optional_variables:
  - node_id
  - pr_number
  - inventory_md
  - notes_md
defaults:
  node_id: ""
  pr_number: ""
  inventory_md: ""
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: dev-complete
  tags:
    - stage:dev
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: sprint
      variable: sprint
    state: dev-complete
    stage: dev
    transition: complete
---
# Dev Complete

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Sprint/Task: {{ sprint }} / {{ task_id }}
{% if node_id %}Node: {{ node_id }}
{% endif %}Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Commit: `{{ commit }}`
PR: {{ ('#' ~ pr_number) if pr_number else 'not opened' }}
Deliverables: {{ deliverables_complete }}/{{ deliverables_total }}

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "sprint": {{ sprint | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "node": {{ (node_id or none) | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "pr": {{ pr_number if pr_number else "null" }},
  "deliverables": {
    "complete": {{ deliverables_complete }},
    "total": {{ deliverables_total }}
  }
}
```

## Deliverables
{{ deliverables_md }}

## Validation
{{ validation_md }}
{% if inventory_md %}
## Targeted Symbol / Code-Path Inventory
{{ inventory_md }}
{% endif %}{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
